    "detailed_description": "&quot;Warrior of Democracy&quot; \u2013 Dive into a World of Epic Battles! This is a 2D shoot 'em up arcade game.<br />\r\nGet ready for an exciting adventure that will make your heart race!<br />\r\n&quot;Warrior of Democracy&quot; is an incredible 2D arcade where you, like a true hero, control a helicopter, battling endless waves of enemy fighters on your path to victory! <br />\r\nIt\u2019s time to take control and show what it means to be a true defender of the democratic skies!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach level presents a new challenge, filled with unique enemies and tense moments.<br />\r\nYour mission is to destroy the fighters, dodge their attacks, and demonstrate agility to overcome all trials! <br />\r\nWith each level you conquer, you will feel your power grow and the thrill of the game capture you even more!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEpic air battles<br />\r\nDiverse levels<br />\r\nBonus system<br />\r\nSimple controls<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSo what are you waiting for? Take to the skies, destroy the enemies, and become the true hero of the democratic skies in &quot;Warrior of Democracy&quot;! <br />\r\nGet ready for battles that will remain in your memory forever!",
